# eXpert API — exemples d'endpoints
# Base: http://localhost:3000/api

### Health (hors préfixe api)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Version latest
GET http://localhost:3000/api/version/latest

### Login Super Admin
# @name login
# Définis @password localement (ne pas committer de vrai mot de passe)
@password = REPLACE_WITH_SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@expert.sarlu",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Liste dossiers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dossiers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Créer dossier
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dossiers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeClient": "PARTICULIER",
  "destination": "Inde — New Delhi",
  "pathologie": "Cardiologie",
  "priorite": "NORMALE",
  "patient": {
    "nom": "Test",
    "prenom": "Patient",
    "telephone": "+243800000000"
  },
  "accompagnateurs": [
    { "nom": "Test", "prenom": "Accompagnant", "lien": "Frère" }
  ]
}

### Tarification (Super Admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tarification
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
